OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening to come with plenty of
OL,7,Flate sunshine. Little change overnight
OL,8,Fwith clear skies and light winds. A
OL,9,Frather warm night to come.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA bright start but patchy
OL,12,Fcloud pushing southward through the
OL,13,Fmorning. Remaining dry throughout
OL,14,Fthough with sunshine returning later.
OL,15,FFeeling a little cooler but still warm.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FLargely dry next week with plenty of
OL,19,Fsunshine and light winds. Turning
OL,20,Fhotter and more humid from mid-week
OL,21,Fwith some very warm nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
